{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2021-06-17 15:00:00', 'title': "AIR PRODUCTS' INVESTOR RELATIONS, CORPORATE RELATIONS AND SUSTAINABILITY VP TO SPEAK AT BANK OF AMERICA'S 3RD HYDROGEN CONFERENCE ON JUNE 24", 'text': "LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., JUNE 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SIMON MOORE , VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS, CORPORATE RELATIONS AND SUSTAINABILITY, WILL SPEAK\xa0AT BANK OF AMERICA'S 3RD HYDROGEN CONFERENCE (VIRTUAL) ON THURSDAY, JUNE 24, 2021 AT 10:15 A.M."}